      "content": "E15 on your Bosch dishwasher usually points to a leak sensor issue, which is a common problem. You'll need to carefully inspect the area around the bottom of the unit where the drain pump and sump are located. Try to locate the leak sensor—it's often a small probe or component near the base—and gently check for any visible water accumulation around it. If you see moisture, you'll need to dry the area thoroughly before attempting a reset or further troubleshooting.",
